Animal Experimentation Ordinance
SR 455.163 — FSVO Ordinance of 12 April 2010 on Laboratory Animal Husbandry, the Production of Genetically Modified Animals and Methods of Animal Experimentation (Animal Experimentation Ordinance).
|

